    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ideally positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac, this immaculately presented mid-terrace two-bedroom property comes to the market with the added benefit of an attic conversion. The accommodation is thoughtfully laid out and filled with natural light, with the kitchen located to the rear of the property, providing direct access to the landscaped garden, which features a garden room.\n\nCharlesland, a well established and well-maintained modern development is becoming increasingly popular with first time buyers, young families and those trading down to a more manageable home. One can walk to the local Supervalue supermarket and neighbourhood shops.\n\nGreystones is an enviable place to live and is well served by public transport networks such as Greystones Dart station and Dublin bus links. For those who drive, the N11 and M50 are close by providing swift access to Dublin and surrounding areas. Primary and secondary schools are within walking distance and one is spoilt for choice when it comes to sports with clubs such as Rugby, football, tennis, golf and GAA all on the doorstep.\n\nSpecial Features\nGas fired central heating with Combi boiler\nDouble glazing throughout.\nDownstairs Wc\nFully equipped modern kitchen with attractive tiled splashbacks\nFitted wardrobes in both bedrooms\nHigh specification and ultra modern bathrooms\nLandscaped rear garden with Astro lawn\nGarden room\nFitted bench seating\nTimber boundary fencing\nCobblelock driveway provides off street parking.\nNicely positioned in quiet cul de sac area.\nWell established development with large open greens.\nPlayground within the development\nWithin walking distance of Supermarket, pharmacy, medical centre, vets and hairdressers.\nShort drive to Greystones Dart station with park and ride facilities.\n\n\nAccommodation\n\nPorch area\nTiled floor. Bespoke fitted units. Glass door leads through to:\n\nLivingroom\nLaminate floor. Electric fire mounted on wall. Tv Point. Recessed lighting. Glass door leads into:\n\nInner hall\nDownstairs Wc\nFully tiled. Push flush wc and ceramic whb set into storage unit with mixer tap. Fitted shelving.\n\nKitchen/ Dining area\nTimber effect tiled floor. High and low level fitted units with attractive tiled splashbacks. Fitted “Bosch” oven and microwave with gas hob and extractor fan. Integrated dishwasher, fridge freezer and washing machine. Recessed lighting. Vertical wall radiator.\n\nUPSTAIRS\n\nLanding \nShelved hotpress. \n\nBedroom 1\nLaminate flooring. Fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2\nLaminate flooring. Fitted wardrobes\n\nBathroom\nUltra modern family bathroom. Fully tiled to a very high specification. Bath with large rose head shower connection and glass screen. Push flush wc and slimline ceramic whb set into storage units with mixer tap. Heated towel rail. \n\nAttic Room\nCurrently used as the master bedroom. Wall to wall modern fitted sliderobes. Recessed lighting. Velux roof windows.\n\nOUTSIDE\nTo the Front:\nCobblelock driveway provides off street parking with boundary hedging. \n\nTo the Rear:\nMainly laid out in lawn with high quality Astro. Composite deck area. Fitted bench seating. Timber boundary fencing. \n\nGarden room.\n"
